					2.59
				</span></i>
			: also abs., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρᾶγμα συντακτὸν περί
				τινος</span>, as a definition of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατηγόρημα</span>, Apollod.ibid., cf. Diog.Bab.ib.<i><span class="en">
				3.213
			</span></i>.</div>
